WEBVTT

00:03.020 --> 00:05.980
<b>THE 53RD TOSEI FESTIVAL</b>

00:09.900 --> 00:11.030
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting!</b>

00:11.030 --> 00:12.280
<b>There she is!</b>

00:12.280 --> 00:14.860
<b>Akane! You're late!</b>

00:14.860 --> 00:16.280
<b>Sorry!</b>

00:20.790 --> 00:24.370
<b>I got called in to work
all of sudden last night.</b>

00:24.670 --> 00:28.250
<b>Then I had to work on my paper,
so I hardly got any sleep.</b>

00:28.250 --> 00:29.550
<b>Seriously?</b>

00:29.550 --> 00:33.010
<b>Convenience stores are so understaffed.
It's a tough job!</b>

00:33.010 --> 00:34.260
<b>Hey!</b>

00:34.760 --> 00:36.010
<b>You guys!</b>

00:36.180 --> 00:54.280
<b>CLASS 2-B
CREPES</b>

00:36.180 --> 00:54.280
<b>CUTE...</b>

00:36.180 --> 00:54.280
<b>HE'S CUTE</b>

00:36.260 --> 00:37.600
<b>Let's get going!</b>

00:37.600 --> 00:39.430
<b>Ohh! So cute!</b>

00:40.720 --> 00:43.100
<b>That person with the rabbit ears
and looking overjoyed,</b>

00:43.100 --> 00:44.480
<b>is that Eita?</b>

00:44.480 --> 00:46.560
<b>He's got a horde of girls snapping him.</b>

00:46.560 --> 00:49.320
<b>Well, Eita's a huge fan
of these festivals.</b>

00:50.110 --> 00:54.280
<b>Huh? Wait up! Wait up, will you?</b>

00:54.650 --> 00:56.160
<b>I said wait up!</b>

00:57.280 --> 01:01.490
<b>CLASS 3-E
COSPLAY CAFE</b>

01:06.500 --> 01:08.670
<b><i>So this is Yamada's school, huh?</i></b>

02:40.010 --> 02:43.010
<b>Episode 8:
If That Happened,That Would Be...</b>

02:44.010 --> 02:47.390
<b>Would you look at all these stalls?</b>

02:47.640 --> 02:49.770
<b>SPONSOR</b>

02:47.770 --> 02:50.190
<b>Hey, Runa, is there
something you'd like to eat?</b>

02:50.190 --> 02:51.400
<b>Runa doesn't want anything.</b>

02:51.400 --> 02:52.230
<b>Huh?</b>

02:56.070 --> 02:59.150
<b>Runa's nervous because
she's taking the entrance exam</b>

02:59.150 --> 03:00.700
<b>for this school next year.</b>

03:00.700 --> 03:02.360
<b>Oh.</b>

03:02.780 --> 03:04.240
<b>Runa! Relax!</b>

03:04.240 --> 03:06.650
<b>This could be an opportunity
to get familiar with this place!</b>

03:06.650 --> 03:08.660
<b>Runa's insecure, so she can't.</b>

03:14.670 --> 03:16.550
<b>CLASS 2-B
MAID CAFE</b>

03:15.210 --> 03:16.550
<b>Welcome!</b>

03:18.920 --> 03:21.050
<b>Yay! I want to go!</b>

03:21.050 --> 03:23.590
<b>I want to go! I want to go! I want to go!</b>

03:21.050 --> 03:26.560
<b>HAUNTED HOUSE</b>

03:23.590 --> 03:24.970
<b>- Ohh.
- I want to go! I want to go!</b>

03:24.970 --> 03:26.560
<b>- Go on, you two!
- I want to go!</b>

03:26.560 --> 03:29.560
<b>Two patients are here.
I'm sending them in!</b>

03:29.560 --> 03:31.310
<b>Hey...</b>

03:32.690 --> 03:34.940
<b>Where should we go, then?</b>

03:34.940 --> 03:36.940
<b>TAKOYAKI
SO DELISH
IN THE QUAD</b>

03:36.940 --> 03:38.940
<b>COSPLAY CAFE
CLASS 3-F</b>

03:43.280 --> 03:44.110
<b>Huh?</b>

03:45.490 --> 03:46.580
<b>My stomach hurts.</b>

03:48.870 --> 03:49.700
<b>What?</b>

03:50.290 --> 03:52.710
<b>I'm so nervous, my stomach hurts!</b>

03:53.290 --> 03:54.960
<b>I can't do this anymore.</b>

03:54.960 --> 03:57.210
<b>If I'm this fragile,
I'll fail the entrance exams—</b>

03:57.210 --> 03:58.590
<b>Okay, stop right there.</b>

03:59.210 --> 04:00.300
<b>Let's go to the restroom.</b>

04:09.220 --> 04:12.480
<b><i>Mr. Kamota and I
just exited the haunted house!</i></b>

04:12.480 --> 04:15.770
<b><i>Let's meet up in about 15 minutes!</i></b>

04:16.520 --> 04:17.980
<b><i>Okay.</i></b>

04:17.480 --> 04:18.730
<b>Okay</b>

04:19.190 --> 04:23.070
<b><i>I wonder if Yamada's
going to join us at some point?</i></b>

04:22.240 --> 04:23.610
<b>NOT THAT I'VE HEARD ANYTHING...</b>

04:23.780 --> 04:24.700
<b><i>I think I'll ask him.</i></b>

04:28.450 --> 04:33.540
<b><i>Wait, if I ask him, he might think
that I want to see him or something.</i></b>

04:34.620 --> 04:38.460
<b><i>Well, I'll find out later without asking,
so never mind!</i></b>

04:40.000 --> 04:42.130
<b>ACCEPTED TO THE CITY ATHLETIC TOURNAMENT
CONGRATULATIONS</b>

04:40.300 --> 04:41.380
<b>What a shock!</b>

04:41.380 --> 04:42.510
<b>Are you all right?</b>

04:42.510 --> 04:43.920
<b>It fell apart!</b>

04:43.920 --> 04:47.390
<b>Oh, man, are you okay?
We'll take care of it.</b>

04:47.600 --> 04:48.640
<b>Thanks!</b>

04:50.600 --> 04:52.180
<b>Bring it into the classroom.</b>

04:54.270 --> 04:55.640
<b>- Yamada—
- Yamada!</b>

04:57.100 --> 04:58.810
<b>Kishida from Ethics class is taking part</b>

04:58.810 --> 05:00.730
<b>in the first-years'
fighting game tournament,</b>

05:00.730 --> 05:02.570
<b>but his moves are totally insane!</b>

05:05.110 --> 05:06.490
<b><i>He's kind of...</i></b>

05:06.990 --> 05:10.490
<b>HE'S SMILING...</b>

05:07.490 --> 05:09.450
<b><i>hard to approach right now.</i></b>

05:08.490 --> 05:10.490
<b>NOWHERE TO PUT
HER HAND</b>

05:10.830 --> 05:13.660
<b>Oh, we're bringing those inside?
Let me help out.</b>

05:11.120 --> 05:12.910
<b><i>Will he look this way, maybe?</i></b>

05:14.120 --> 05:16.210
<b><i>Hey, Yamada...</i></b>

05:18.040 --> 05:20.170
<b><i>Oh. There he goes.</i></b>

05:25.170 --> 05:26.840
<b><i>Oh, well, it is what it is.</i></b>

05:27.340 --> 05:28.760
<b><i>He seemed busy, anyway.</i></b>

05:28.760 --> 05:30.510
<b><i>Of course he wouldn't notice me.</i></b>

05:34.060 --> 05:35.270
<b><i>For heaven's sake...</i></b>

05:37.350 --> 05:41.020
<b>I told them to start putting away
the boxes they were done with first,</b>

05:41.020 --> 05:42.610
<b>but they're just leaving them out.</b>

05:42.610 --> 05:45.320
<b>Everyone's so sloppy, right?</b>

05:45.320 --> 05:48.240
<b>Tsubaki, is it all right
if I step out for a minute?</b>

05:48.240 --> 05:51.030
<b>Hmm? I don't have a problem with that,
but where are you going?</b>

05:52.410 --> 05:53.240
<b>Nowhere special.</b>

05:59.170 --> 06:00.630
<b><i>She's been in there a while.</i></b>

06:02.590 --> 06:04.170
<b>I think I'll go check on her.</b>

06:16.560 --> 06:17.690
<b>Are you alone?</b>

06:23.940 --> 06:26.940
<b>You noticed that I was here?</b>

06:27.610 --> 06:32.450
<b>Yes. I was going to call out to you,
but then we had some trouble.</b>

06:35.330 --> 06:37.500
<b>Anyway, why are you alone?</b>

06:41.040 --> 06:42.080
<b>Why...</b>

06:43.500 --> 06:44.960
<b>are you smiling?</b>

06:47.050 --> 06:49.220
<b>Oh... it's nothing.</b>

07:00.560 --> 07:03.610
<b>Runa seems to have a case of the nerves,
so she's been in the restroom.</b>

07:04.400 --> 07:07.740
<b>But I'm getting worried
since it's been a while,</b>

07:07.740 --> 07:11.910
<b>so I was just about to go check on her.</b>

07:16.830 --> 07:17.660
<b>I can't do it.</b>

07:18.160 --> 07:22.000
<b>There's no way that I can make it
through the real entrance exam like this.</b>

07:22.000 --> 07:26.250
<b>I JUST CAN'T HANDLE PRESSURE</b>

07:22.290 --> 07:25.750
<b>You don't have a fever, so just lie down,
and we'll see how it goes.</b>

07:28.380 --> 07:30.800
<b>Yamada... what are you doing?</b>

07:31.300 --> 07:32.340
<b>I'm letting Eita know—</b>

07:34.090 --> 07:35.760
<b>Don't! Don't! Don't! Don't!</b>

07:35.760 --> 07:38.520
<b>Don't tell Eita about this!
He's so going to take me home!</b>

07:38.520 --> 07:39.890
<b>I can't not tell him.</b>

07:39.890 --> 07:43.150
<b>But I haven't eaten anything yummy yet,
and I haven't had any fun!</b>

07:43.690 --> 07:45.150
<b>I thought you had a stomachache.</b>

07:45.150 --> 07:47.270
<b>But I want to eat all kinds of food here!</b>

07:47.730 --> 07:50.650
<b>That's why I haven't eaten a thing
since last night, you know!</b>

07:51.070 --> 07:52.450
<b>That must be the cause!</b>

07:52.450 --> 07:55.160
<b>Oh! Then I'll just go buy
some stuff for you.</b>

07:55.160 --> 07:58.040
<b>I TOTALLY FORGOT,
BUT I'M YOUR SPONSOR</b>

07:55.530 --> 07:58.040
<b>So that you can have it
once you're feeling better, okay?</b>

08:01.960 --> 08:02.790
<b>In that case...</b>

08:03.670 --> 08:07.380
<b>I want a crepe,
a cheese dog, and takoyaki.</b>

08:07.710 --> 08:10.050
<b>And they were selling
pork miso soup in the courtyard,</b>

08:10.050 --> 08:11.340
<b>so I want some of that, too.</b>

08:11.340 --> 08:14.970
<b>And I just have to have
a limited edition festival T-shirt.</b>

08:14.970 --> 08:16.390
<b>Sure, sure.</b>

08:16.390 --> 08:19.890
<b>AKANE</b>

08:16.680 --> 08:18.850
<b>Where do they sell
the festival tees?</b>

08:18.470 --> 08:19.890
<b>YAMADA</b>

08:18.850 --> 08:19.890
<b>I'll take you there.</b>

08:20.180 --> 08:21.850
<b>See you later.</b>

08:26.690 --> 08:29.980
<b>Yamada, is it okay for you
not to be working with your classmates?</b>

08:29.980 --> 08:31.570
<b>Hey, look! Look at that!</b>

08:31.570 --> 08:35.410
<b>Yes. I was going to take off
in the afternoon, anyway.</b>

08:31.900 --> 08:33.200
<b>Hey, who's that?</b>

08:33.200 --> 08:34.700
<b>No way! His girlfriend?</b>

08:34.700 --> 08:35.660
<b>For real?</b>

08:35.410 --> 08:36.990
<b>I'm glad to hear that.</b>

08:38.030 --> 08:42.160
<b>It's backstage work,
so we're pretty free once it's underway.</b>

08:39.620 --> 08:41.830
<b>No way, he's with someone!</b>

08:41.830 --> 08:45.670
<b>I thought Yamada didn't have a girlfriend.</b>

08:42.160 --> 08:46.080
<b>Oh, really?
What's your class doing, Yamada?</b>

08:47.000 --> 08:51.300
<b>We teamed up with the class next door
to make a giant labyrinth outside.</b>

08:52.090 --> 08:53.050
<b>Anyway...</b>

08:53.050 --> 08:54.680
<b>Is that his girlfriend?</b>

08:53.050 --> 08:59.930
<b>BED OF NAILS</b>

08:53.550 --> 08:55.800
<b>are people totally staring at us?</b>

08:54.680 --> 08:56.510
<b>- No!
- Who is that woman?</b>

08:56.510 --> 08:59.760
<b>Oh, you noticed, too? Thank goodness!</b>

09:00.220 --> 09:02.980
<b><i>Feels like a knife to the back.
I'm going to walk ahead.</i></b>

09:04.020 --> 09:05.480
<b>- Oh, sorry.
- Hey.</b>

09:07.060 --> 09:10.770
<b>Hey, Yamada! So you've been
wandering around here, huh?</b>

09:10.770 --> 09:13.740
<b>I hear you're finally taking part
in the pageant this year!</b>

09:13.740 --> 09:17.110
<b>So you couldn't quite escape it
for the whole three years, huh?</b>

09:17.110 --> 09:18.030
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:28.920 --> 09:32.420
<b>POW POW POW</b>

09:29.250 --> 09:31.880
<b>Look at you! You're with a girl? Hey!</b>

09:32.670 --> 09:36.630
<b>I always thought you were a perverse guy,
not caring how popular you were,</b>

09:35.420 --> 09:41.430
<b>YAMADA... STAND UP
FOR YOURSELF A LITTLE...</b>

09:36.630 --> 09:38.590
<b>but I'm changing my tune now, you punk!</b>

09:38.590 --> 09:41.430
<b>Hey, Yamada! Yamada, hey!</b>

09:41.810 --> 09:43.470
<b>Huh? I've never seen you before.</b>

09:43.970 --> 09:45.560
<b>Which high school do you go to?</b>

09:45.680 --> 09:48.650
<b>Oh, no. I'm a college student, and—</b>

09:48.650 --> 09:49.690
<b>Older?</b>

09:48.810 --> 09:49.690
<b>TOO CLOSE...</b>

09:49.770 --> 09:52.400
<b>- Older?
- Older?</b>

09:50.650 --> 09:55.320
<b>I see! You like older women, then?
Good for you!</b>

09:52.400 --> 09:53.820
<b>Older?</b>

09:56.740 --> 09:58.700
<b>You've made me really happy, you know!</b>

09:59.870 --> 10:03.160
<b>Wow. He was totally
a jock-type of teacher, huh?</b>

10:00.950 --> 10:03.410
<b>Well! Who knew that
Yamada, of all people,</b>

10:03.410 --> 10:06.540
<b>would go
for older women?</b>

10:03.620 --> 10:04.790
<b>He's my P.E. teacher.</b>

10:04.700 --> 10:07.580
<b>AT A LOSS
FOR WORDS</b>

10:05.290 --> 10:06.290
<b>Oh?</b>

10:08.620 --> 10:09.920
<b>Yamada!</b>

10:14.550 --> 10:16.550
<b>Is that person your girlfriend?</b>

10:16.550 --> 10:26.680
<b>PEEP PEEP PEEP</b>

10:16.720 --> 10:18.720
<b>- How long have you been dating?
- Who is she?</b>

10:18.720 --> 10:20.300
<b>Do you prefer older women?</b>

10:20.300 --> 10:21.350
<b>Who are they?</b>

10:21.350 --> 10:24.430
<b>First years, I think?
Going by the color of their shoes.</b>

10:24.430 --> 10:26.060
<b>Gotta hand it to the youth...</b>

10:27.230 --> 10:29.310
<b>Um, I'm not his girlfriend.</b>

10:29.810 --> 10:30.690
<b>Oh!</b>

10:31.060 --> 10:32.980
<b>So you're really not dating, then?</b>

10:32.980 --> 10:33.940
<b>Is that true?</b>

10:33.940 --> 10:35.820
<b>Then why are you together?</b>

10:35.820 --> 10:37.740
<b>Yamada! Why is that?</b>

10:37.740 --> 10:38.820
<b>Who is this person?</b>

10:38.820 --> 10:41.410
<b>It's not true
that you like older women, right?</b>

10:47.200 --> 10:53.710
<b>RAGGED...</b>

10:47.200 --> 10:53.710
<b>INTERROGATED
BY NUMEROUS GIRLS
ALONG THE WAY</b>

10:47.450 --> 10:50.170
<b><i>We finally made it out of the building.</i></b>

10:50.960 --> 10:52.880
<b>I'm totally exhausted.</b>

10:54.040 --> 10:55.300
<b>Hey!</b>

10:55.300 --> 10:57.970
<b>Oh, there's Akito, too!</b>

10:58.220 --> 11:00.050
<b>We bought tons of stuff!</b>

11:03.890 --> 11:06.470
<b>Runa's got a stomachache again?</b>

11:06.930 --> 11:09.270
<b>Huh? Akanecchi, did you just age?</b>

11:09.600 --> 11:13.110
<b>Listen, both of you! It was such an ordeal
just getting here, you know!</b>

11:14.520 --> 11:18.530
<b>We got the festival tee that Runa wanted!</b>

11:14.770 --> 11:18.740
<b>Let me guess, the campus was abuzz
because Akito was with a girl, am I right?</b>

11:18.530 --> 11:23.740
<b>And here's a cheese dog, some takoyaki,
and also—also...</b>

11:18.740 --> 11:20.700
<b>Same thing happened to Runa last year.</b>

11:20.700 --> 11:22.110
<b>Well, this was no joke!</b>

11:22.110 --> 11:23.740
<b>You should have seen their eyes!</b>

11:24.070 --> 11:27.700
<b>It's like it was even less convincing
because I'm not his girlfriend!</b>

11:26.240 --> 11:29.000
<b>WHAT DO THEY
WANT ME TO DO?</b>

11:27.370 --> 11:32.370
<b>SMIRK</b>

11:27.700 --> 11:29.040
<b>I wish I could have seen that.</b>

11:29.000 --> 11:32.290
<b>You swaggering about
as you crush the hopes of every girl!</b>

11:32.290 --> 11:34.290
<b>That's not it! It was a misunderstanding!</b>

11:36.000 --> 11:38.550
<b>Well, then, if you're
going to get death stares anyway,</b>

11:38.550 --> 11:40.090
<b>don't you think you might as well...</b>

11:41.300 --> 11:43.470
<b>just start dating?</b>

11:46.140 --> 11:50.390
<b>DON'T YOU THINK YOU MIGHT AS WELL
JUST START DATING?</b>

11:50.980 --> 11:51.890
<b>Right, Akito?</b>

11:58.030 --> 12:00.030
<b>Well... well...</b>

12:00.570 --> 12:01.610
<b>yeah, I guess.</b>

12:02.070 --> 12:03.320
<b>Huh?</b>

12:03.530 --> 12:06.280
<b>- Akanecchi's so cheery. Isn't she great?
- What? What are you—</b>

12:06.280 --> 12:07.120
<b>I guess so.</b>

12:07.120 --> 12:09.700
<b>Her hobby's online gaming,
so you're like a perfect match.</b>

12:08.910 --> 12:10.830
<b>Hey! You're so out of line—</b>

12:09.700 --> 12:10.830
<b>I guess so.</b>

12:11.080 --> 12:13.370
<b>All right! You're officially a couple!</b>

12:13.370 --> 12:14.420
<b>Just kidding!</b>

12:20.130 --> 12:22.800
<b>A-Akanecchi.</b>

12:28.470 --> 12:30.270
<b>S-Sorry!</b>

12:30.270 --> 12:31.350
<b>Huh?</b>

12:31.350 --> 12:32.560
<b>I was just kidding!</b>

12:33.060 --> 12:34.310
<b>What?</b>

12:34.310 --> 12:41.320
<b>REALIZING IT WAS A JOKE,
HE THINKS HE PLAYED ALONG LIKE A PRO</b>

12:34.810 --> 12:37.770
<b>Sorry! Sorry!
I was just teasing Akito, okay?</b>

12:36.900 --> 12:41.320
<b>STILL HASN'T
CAUGHT ON</b>

12:37.770 --> 12:39.610
<b>Oh... kidding.</b>

12:39.610 --> 12:41.320
<b>That's right!
Sorry, okay?</b>

12:46.990 --> 12:47.830
<b>Whoa.</b>

12:48.160 --> 12:50.910
<b>I've got some shopping to do!
Runa's food!</b>

12:50.910 --> 12:51.950
<b>A-Akanecchi!</b>

12:52.330 --> 12:53.710
<b>Akane.</b>

12:57.710 --> 12:58.630
<b>I hate you, Eita!</b>

13:01.800 --> 13:03.800
<b>Don't you give me
a hard time too, Yamada!</b>

13:04.720 --> 13:06.140
<b>Damn it!</b>

13:07.390 --> 13:10.810
<b><i>Oh, crap. I was just messing with Akito,
but I ended up hurting Akenecchi, too.</i></b>

13:11.430 --> 13:13.980
<b>You two wait here, okay?
I'm going to go apologize to her.</b>

13:36.580 --> 13:38.380
<b><i>In a situation like that, I should have...</i></b>

13:40.170 --> 13:43.010
<b><i>Don't you think
you might as well just start dating?</i></b>

13:43.340 --> 13:45.880
<b><i>Right, right. That's enough joking around.</i></b>

13:46.220 --> 13:48.260
<b><i>That would have been the right response.</i></b>

13:52.390 --> 13:53.270
<b><i>But...</i></b>

13:57.730 --> 14:01.020
<b><i>What's wrong with me?
Why am I reacting in this crazy way?</i></b>

14:02.400 --> 14:05.610
<b><i>Yamada sure had a blank stare on his face.</i></b>

14:07.530 --> 14:09.030
<b><i>I'm so embarrassed!</i></b>

14:09.030 --> 14:10.780
<b>RETRO CAFE</b>

14:11.200 --> 14:12.830
<b>I-I'm so sorry!</b>

14:12.910 --> 14:13.790
<b>STARE...</b>

14:14.330 --> 14:16.540
<b>Please walk slowly through the halls.</b>

14:18.080 --> 14:19.000
<b>Yamada?</b>

14:20.960 --> 14:21.790
<b>Hey! Wait.</b>

14:22.710 --> 14:23.800
<b>Don't run!</b>

14:29.970 --> 14:32.560
<b>Hey, Yamada. Is that person with you?</b>

14:36.930 --> 14:37.940
<b>Akane!</b>

14:38.560 --> 14:40.020
<b>Please just stop for now.</b>

14:52.320 --> 14:54.410
<b>The stairs... it's not safe.</b>

14:58.910 --> 15:00.250
<b>Don't make her run, okay?</b>

15:10.010 --> 15:11.760
<b>What happened just now,
sorry about that.</b>

15:12.180 --> 15:13.720
<b>My name...</b>

15:14.430 --> 15:15.810
<b>you said it for the first time!</b>

15:16.180 --> 15:19.440
<b>What? No, that can't be true.</b>

15:19.770 --> 15:22.400
<b>But it is true!
I'm sure it's the first time!</b>

15:22.980 --> 15:25.480
<b>You've gone so long
without calling me by my name,</b>

15:25.480 --> 15:30.280
<b>I was secretly convinced that you
didn't know my name in the first place!</b>

15:27.690 --> 15:31.410
<b>I KNOW
YOUR NAME</b>

15:29.950 --> 15:31.410
<b>AS MY LEADING
HYPOTHESIS!!</b>

15:30.280 --> 15:31.410
<b>That's ridiculous.</b>

15:32.530 --> 15:34.120
<b>Who's that girl?</b>

15:32.530 --> 15:36.620
<b>So... about what just happened...</b>

15:34.120 --> 15:36.620
<b>- Yamada's with a girl.
- Are you kidding me?</b>

15:45.920 --> 15:47.420
<b>Come over here with me!</b>

15:49.670 --> 15:52.680
<b>Sorry to drag you to a deserted area.</b>

15:53.220 --> 15:55.760
<b>I couldn't ignore
those murderous looks behind my back.</b>

15:55.760 --> 15:57.430
<b>Is that what you felt?</b>

15:57.470 --> 16:00.560
<b>OKAY, NO ONE'S AROUND...</b>

16:00.560 --> 16:02.390
<b>Sorry about what happened before.</b>

16:04.610 --> 16:07.020
<b>I had no intention of teasing you.</b>

16:08.570 --> 16:12.610
<b>I knew that Eita was joking around again,
so I started to just—</b>

16:12.610 --> 16:13.780
<b>H-Hold up!</b>

16:14.160 --> 16:16.830
<b>It's not like I'm mad,
so let's not talk about this anymore!</b>

16:16.830 --> 16:17.830
<b>What?</b>

16:18.240 --> 16:20.040
<b>You're not mad?</b>

16:21.000 --> 16:23.330
<b>But a second ago, you were clearly mad.</b>

16:23.330 --> 16:25.210
<b>I wasn't, okay? I really wasn't!</b>

16:26.460 --> 16:27.670
<b>It's just that...</b>

16:28.590 --> 16:32.260
<b>I-I guess I was a little embarrassed...</b>

16:32.760 --> 16:34.840
<b>so I ended up...</b>

16:33.760 --> 16:36.970
<b>SORRY...</b>

16:35.340 --> 16:36.470
<b>saying those things.</b>

16:39.390 --> 16:44.100
<b>Huh? Sorry, which part
made you feel embarrassed?</b>

16:44.100 --> 16:46.400
<b>Can you please not ask about that?</b>

16:48.650 --> 16:51.490
<b>So you really aren't mad?</b>

16:54.070 --> 16:56.450
<b>I told you, I'm not mad at all.</b>

17:00.040 --> 17:01.540
<b>I'm glad to hear that.</b>

17:12.050 --> 17:14.380
<b>All right, do you want to go shopping?</b>

17:15.380 --> 17:16.220
<b>What if...</b>

17:19.390 --> 17:26.440
<b>if I'd taken Eita's joke seriously and
said, "Okay, I'll start dating Yamada"?</b>

17:30.400 --> 17:36.450
<b>If I'd said that,
what would you have done, Yamada?</b>

18:03.270 --> 18:05.520
<b>Just—Just kidding!</b>

18:06.020 --> 18:09.190
<b>Someone might actually take it seriously,
just like that,</b>

18:09.190 --> 18:12.610
<b>so you shouldn't joke
about romantic stuff!</b>

18:12.610 --> 18:13.820
<b>Got that?</b>

18:13.820 --> 18:15.990
<b>- Yes.
- All right! Come on, then!</b>

18:17.990 --> 18:20.160
<b><i>Something's wrong with me!
Something's wrong with me!</i></b>

18:20.160 --> 18:24.120
<b>If that happened, that would be...</b>

18:24.120 --> 18:25.910
<b>a real honor.</b>

18:32.500 --> 18:35.420
<b>But for a nobody like me,</b>

18:35.710 --> 18:39.010
<b>you're like a prize that I can't reach,</b>

18:39.010 --> 18:41.470
<b>so I've never really thought about it.</b>

18:42.680 --> 18:44.140
<b>A PRIZE THAT HE
CAN'T REACH</b>

18:42.970 --> 18:44.140
<b>Yamada!</b>

18:46.520 --> 18:48.440
<b>What? Are you being serious with me?</b>

18:48.690 --> 18:50.860
<b>ALTHOUGH IT IS
KIND OF INTERESTING</b>

18:49.520 --> 18:50.350
<b>Yes.</b>

18:52.770 --> 18:55.990
<b>That's how you've been seeing me?</b>

18:56.780 --> 18:57.610
<b>Yes.</b>

19:02.030 --> 19:03.740
<b>What were we supposed to buy again?</b>

19:08.250 --> 19:09.710
<b>Wait for me!</b>

19:11.670 --> 19:15.090
<b>A crepe, a cheese dog, some takoyaki,
and pork miso soup.</b>

19:18.300 --> 19:20.680
<b>Also, I think you're
a pretty fun guy, Yamada!</b>

19:21.340 --> 19:22.340
<b>For real?</b>

20:57.270 --> 21:01.070
<b>I'm begging you! Please enter
the pageant this year, Yamada!</b>

21:01.070 --> 21:02.990
<b>No, I'm telling you, it's not happening.</b>

21:02.990 --> 21:04.860
<b>Come on, don't be like that!</b>

21:04.860 --> 21:06.740
<b>Just look outside the classroom!</b>

21:10.160 --> 21:11.290
<b>- See?
- Not doing it.</b>

21:11.290 --> 21:27.390
<b>TOSEI FESTIVAL
STARTS IN 1 DAY</b>

21:11.410 --> 21:13.790
<b>Please! This is our last festival!</b>

21:13.790 --> 21:17.250
<b>We want our last festival
to be the most memorable of all!</b>

21:17.250 --> 21:18.210
<b>That's right!</b>

21:18.790 --> 21:21.170
<b>I guess being too handsome
can be a headache, too.</b>

21:21.170 --> 21:24.090
<b>And he's an awesome gamer, too.
That's cheating!</b>

21:27.760 --> 21:29.930
<b>Isn't it about time
you put a stop to that?</b>

21:31.560 --> 21:33.100
<b>If you say so.</b>

21:35.100 --> 21:37.150
<b>I'm in!</b>

21:37.150 --> 21:37.980
<b>Huh?</b>

21:41.440 --> 21:43.240
<b>Okamoto, what do you think you're doing?</b>

21:43.650 --> 21:45.740
<b>Hey, just leave it to me!</b>

21:45.740 --> 21:48.870
<b>THE DAY OF THE TOSEI FESTIVAL</b>

21:49.990 --> 21:52.540
<b>And now the moment
you've all been waiting for!</b>

21:50.200 --> 21:58.540
<b>MR. TOSEI FESTIVAL PAGEANT</b>

21:52.540 --> 21:54.830
<b>The guy who's refused to enter
the Mr. Tousei Pageant</b>

21:54.830 --> 21:56.460
<b>for two years running!</b>

21:56.460 --> 21:58.540
<b>Here he is now!</b>

22:02.800 --> 22:04.630
<b>Entry number six!</b>

22:05.130 --> 22:09.010
<b>Class 3-A, Akito Yamada!</b>

22:18.770 --> 22:24.110
<b>Now batting for Yamada,
pinch hitter Okamoto!</b>

22:26.110 --> 22:28.820
<b>Play ball!</b>

22:42.090 --> 22:43.880
<b>Where's Yamada?</b>

22:43.880 --> 22:45.210
<b>Take a hike, Okamoto!</b>

22:45.210 --> 22:46.800
<b>No one asked for you!</b>

22:47.090 --> 22:50.390
<b>Right, my favorite foods
are hamburgers and fries.</b>

22:50.390 --> 22:52.930
<b>And I can't stand campers and snipers.</b>

22:52.930 --> 22:54.350
<b>I'm Takeaki Okamoto!</b>

22:54.930 --> 22:55.810
<b>Vote for me!</b>

22:55.810 --> 22:57.640
<b>Let's go, Okamoto!</b>

22:58.980 --> 23:00.560
<b>Come on, Okamoto!</b>

23:00.560 --> 23:01.690
<b>Are you serious?</b>

23:01.690 --> 23:04.110
<b>- We want to see Yamada!
- Go, Okamoto!</b>

23:04.110 --> 23:06.070
<b>Make this place rock in Yamada's place!</b>

23:06.070 --> 23:07.700
<b>What's a camper?</b>

23:08.030 --> 23:11.410
<b>Please follow the rules for cheering!</b>

23:13.280 --> 23:15.700
<b>At least buy him a hamburger later.</b>

23:16.750 --> 23:17.660
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

23:24.000 --> 23:25.380
<b>Let your big bro have some, too.</b>

23:25.380 --> 23:26.210
<b>Huh!</b>

23:26.460 --> 23:28.470
<b>Big Bro is hungry!</b>

23:28.470 --> 23:29.300
<b>Huh!</b>

23:29.300 --> 23:30.800
<b>Just one bite!</b>

23:30.800 --> 23:31.970
<b>Ready? Ahh!</b>

23:31.970 --> 23:33.010
<b>Creepy!</b>

23:33.760 --> 23:34.600
<b>Huh?</b>

23:35.720 --> 23:38.980
<b>SOUNDS LIKE A PARTY OUT THERE</b>
